OL,3,AAzerbaijan pardons Frenchman after EU
OL,4,Alifts sanctions on Russian billionaire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench national Martin Ryan has been
OL,7,Fpardoned and his release from prison
OL,8,Fordered by Azerbaijani President Ilham
OL,9,FAliyev after he was jailed on charges
OL,10,Fof spying.
OL,12,FHis release came hours after the EU
OL,13,Fagreed to lift sanctions on two Russian
OL,14,Fbillionaires, prompting anger from
OL,15,FUkraine. Diplomats had indicated that
OL,16,FFrance had pushed for an end to
OL,17,Frestrictions on one of the businessmen,
OL,18,FAlisher Usmanov.
OL,20,FRyan, who denied espionage, is one of
OL,21,F20 people pardoned by Aliyev.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
